    "circulation_reference_plan": "calibration/circulation_audit_20261026/plan.json",
    "physical_definition": "Keep original total calibrated legacy Ws and ocean column water, r39 source/sink/thermal/winds and Earth planetary profile. Solve two independent positive steady water amounts at each seasonal step, lower dry mass25%, upper75%. Diagnose donor vertical air exchange from lower continuity; total dry air remains balanced on exact common faces. Optional symmetric mixing conductance=M*.25*.75/(5days), or zero. Lower air alone receives sea/land evaporation, with original ocean exchange evaluated at actual lower water divided by moist-profile lower capacity fraction. Each layer rains against its normalized moist hydrostatic saturation fraction using the original closure; drying and linear conservative storms act on each actual layer. Moist profile only partitions capacity and boundary water; no reset of actual humidity. Keep legacy absolute capacities to isolate vertical water dynamics from the failed pressure-capacity experiment. Old fixed moisture_upper_q_ratio no longer controls solution (bit-exact coupled toy test). No resolved vertical temperature, time storage, latent heating or new momentum claim. Both actual per-layer and summed-column equations must meet unchanged residual tolerance, including actual updated evaporation switch, horizontal/vertical fluxes and storm exchange. Independent sparse-matrix residual required after fast block sweeps.",
    "control": "21 exact controls before14 new candidates:7 original r39 monthly climate/native-wind controls;7 common-mass fixed-profile controls;7 pressure-moist RH.45 controls. Every saved control NPZ field must reproduce exactly, including NaNs; new humidity reports are JSON only for old profiles. New layers saved only for independent states. No adaptive candidates or calibration points.",
    "screen": "All strict numerical/conservative-vapor/storm checks and scaled column-mass residual<=1e-10 required. Same accuracy guards: S<=.995, mean rain ratio<=.99,T ratio<=1.01; NI rain ratio<=.95; Iran<=1.02; every other region S<=1.02. Actual integrated SST MAE increase<=.02C on identical observation-only masks, column speed max<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s. Fixed outside-wind guards: NI native partial-column vector RMSE improvement>=5%; Iberia ocean/EastAustralia lowland worsening<=2%, identical masks and areas. No additional candidate, weakened threshold or new validation sampling after outcomes. Also require two_layer_transport certificate with dry-column residual<=1e-10 and EACH branch wind maximum<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s (all primer/scored steps), rather than hiding a fast return in the weighted mean. Exactly2 fixed reservoir closures, with strict layer/column certificates throughout. Additionally predeclare Iberia ocean native monthly partial humidity protection against the rerun fixed-profile transport control: PW925-300 MAE and upper700-300/lower925-700 mean specific-humidity ratio MAE may each worsen at most2%, with identical native cells/areas. Observed anchor is not assimilated; use actual solved model water and model piecewise-uniform layer q integrated over exactly matched pressures. Exclude any footprint containing model below-ground925hPa. Full-column humidity ratio is not compared directly with partial observations. No new error limit or candidate after outcomes.",
    "advance": "Best at most2 qualifiers advance through unchanged full31 policy_v2 and individual regional protections, integrated ocean/wind checks, paired28km four-region S<=1.01 plus NI rain<=.98 and established6 S<=1.01. All independent layer/column, mass, branch-speed and tracer certificates required at every stage. Repeat56km Iberia ocean humidity protection in the ocean gate; before adoption also run additional paired28km Iberia humidity control/candidate with same2% separate PW/shape limits (at most3 extra actual solves across2 finalists). Existing development sets remain reused, not independent validation. Fantasy/world qualification remains separate.",
    "publication": "35 fixed actual coupled Earth runs,21 exact controls then14 candidates; all failures retained. At most2 predeclared qualifiers may proceed to full gates. Publish results and actual solved humidity diagnostics without replacing fantasy climate or headline score unless separate gates pass. Supervisor source-change stop and2h ceiling, no automatic exports or Git writes.",
